# ESP32-S3 Test Documentation

## Introduction

This document describes the current PlatformIO test setup for the ESP32-S3
parking project. It explains how the test suite is organized, which scenarios
are covered, how validation is performed, and which test types are used.

The suite is split across two files:

- [test_all.cpp](test_all.cpp): Unity test runner and logical/unit-style tests
- [test_hardware.cpp](test_hardware.cpp): hardware-specific smoke test helpers

Together they verify the reusable modules under `lib/`.

